/* ============================================================
   MARTIN SERIAL NUMBER LOOKUP & GUIDE — Archetype C (info-guide page)
   ============================================================
   Faithful port of the live /martin-serial-and-model-numbers/ page.

   The serial-number lookup tool is ported verbatim from live (per user
