     - guitarData:   1898–2024, full a/b ranges
     - lxData:       2005–2024 (Little Martin LX, last-serial-of-year)
     - mandolinData: 1895–1993 (last-serial-of-year)
     - navSolidData: 2010–2024 (Navojoa Solid Wood Ukulele)
     - navHplData:   2010–2024 (Navojoa HPL Ukulele)
